#: GuiInstallRecalbox.cpp — pre-flight size check
msgid "Checking available disk space..."
msgstr "Vérification de l'espace disque disponible..."

msgid ""
"Not enough space on the target disk.\n"
"\n"
"The content of **/recalbox/share** ({SIZE_SHARE}) does not fit in the "
"available SHARE partition ({SIZE_AVAIL}).\n"
"\n"
"Please use a larger disk or free up space on /recalbox/share first."
msgstr ""
"Espace insuffisant sur le disque cible.\n"
"\n"
"Le contenu de **/recalbox/share** ({SIZE_SHARE}) ne tient pas dans la "
"partition SHARE disponible ({SIZE_AVAIL}).\n"
"\n"
"Utilisez un disque plus grand ou libérez d'abord de l'espace sur /recalbox/"
"share."

